# Git attribution

Never add any of the following to commits, commit messages, or pull requests in this repository:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- `Made-with: Cursor` (or similar trailers)
- Any other Cursor/agent co-author or attribution trailer

Commits must only reflect the human author configured for this repo (`0xJonaseb11 <sebejaz99@gmail.com>`).

When creating git commits via shell, use plain `git commit -m "message"` with no trailers.
